\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Task execution duration across the five modes: fixed parameters (A), operator selection (B), full cross-channel scheduling (C), visual-semantic cue only (D), and impedance-only scheduling (E). Each mode contains 27 matched task blocks. Filled circles show medians, thick horizontal segments show IQRs, and thin horizontal segments with end caps show 1.5 $\times $ IQR Tukey whiskers; small open circles show observations beyond the whiskers. Mode C was lower than modes A, B, D, and E in Holm-adjusted paired Wilcoxon tests (all $p<0.01$).}}{11}{}\protected@file@percent }
