\newlabel{fig:7}{{7}{12}{}{figure.7}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Paired completion-time comparison between modes C and E (27 matched blocks across three operators). (a) Points below the identity line indicate a shorter duration in mode C. (b) Paired improvement, $\Delta T=T_E-T_C$; positive values favor mode C. The violin, horizontal segment, and diamond show the distribution, median, and mean improvement (1.79 s; bootstrap 95\% CI [1.10, 2.51] s), respectively.}}{12}{}\protected@file@percent }
